// 上屏日志要同步（Windows / 安卓各一份），规则在 stignore-recent-commits.txt，
// 用 include 引进来；位置必须在下面的 *.log 之前——Syncthing 是"首条匹配生效"。
#include stignore-recent-commits.txt
(?d).git/
(?d).gitattributes
(?d)*.sync-conflict-*
(?d)build
(?d)installation.yaml
(?d)user.yaml
(?d)*.userdb
(?d)*.userdb/
(?d)*.userdb.old
(?d)*.userdb.old/
(?d)*.userdb.old/**
(?d)user.custom.dict.txt
(?d)*.bin
(?d)*.log
(?d)*.bak
(?d)__pycache__
(?d).DS_Store
(?d)Thumbs.db
(?d)desktop.ini
(?d)/sync
